  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bougainville Moderator Support Project (MSP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The primary objective of the Moderator and MSP is to &#xbf;assist both parties to address the outstanding substantive issues and the role of Parliament in the process of reaching agreement on the future political status of Bougainville.&#xbf;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: windowtext;&quot;&gt;The outcome of which would be that the GoPNG and the ABG will have redefined their relationship and articulated a clear pathway on the future political status of Bougainville and specific actions to be taken by both parties. Agreement of both parties on the future political status of Bougainville shall contribute to a peaceful and sustainable way forward.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
